{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  Made-to-measure field data — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH.
  Plain text, one record per line. Edit here only.

  Field lines (A, B):   key|label|section
  Garment map (C):      sheet|garment|group|comma,separated,keys
                        (garment is matched against product.type, case-insensitive;
                         a garment may appear on several lines, one group each)

  Keys feed AB Measure and must never be renamed. Labels become the readable
  line-item property names shown in cart and on the order.

  Consumed with {% include 'mtm-fields' %} so these variables share scope:
    mtm_he, mtm_she, mtm_garments
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

